OL,3,GNEWSADrumcree dispute could lead to
OL,4,Aissues with other marches, say
OL,5,Aresidents
OL,6,
OL,7,FA stand-off over a decision to allow a
OL,8,Fparade down a predominantly nationalist
OL,9,Froad could lead to issues with Orange
OL,10,FOrder marches in other areas, according
OL,11,Fto a residents' group.
OL,13,FThere have been 11 days of deadlock
OL,14,Fbetween Garvaghy Road residents and the
OL,15,Flocal Orange Order over the proposed
OL,16,Fmarch in Portadown, County Armagh.
OL,18,FThe Garvaghy Road Residents Coalition
OL,19,F(GRRC) met 11 nationalist residents'
OL,20,Fgroups on Wednesday. Afterwards, Linda
OL,21,FO'Neill of the GRRC said: "This is no
OL,22,Flonger just about the Garvaghy Road."
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
